  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Conciliation Resources arbetar med fredsbyggande program i Kaukasus, Colombia, DRC, Fiji, Guinea, Indien, Liberia, Pakistan, Filippinerna, Sierra Leone, S&#xF6;dra Sudan och Uganda i partnerskap med lokala och internationalla enskilda organisationer och regeringar. 2010-st&#xF6;det &#xE4;r ett bryggst&#xF6;d i syfte att utv&#xE4;rdera organisationen efter 13-&#xE5;rs Sidast&#xF6;d.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conciliation Resources works on peace-building issues with programmes in Caucasus, Colombia, DRC, Fiji, Guinea, India, Liberia, Pakistan, the Phillipines, Sierra Leone, Southern Sudan and Uganda in  partnership with local and international civil society organisations and governments. The 2010 support is a briding support with the purpose of evaluating the organisation after 13 years of Sida support</narrative>
  </description>
